# Operating-system and editor bookkeeping. None of it is part of the game.
#
# Seeded once by tools/package-github-pages.mjs in the EUC Thrills project
# folder, and never rewritten by it afterwards. This file is yours to edit.
#
# Finder recreates .DS_Store in this folder constantly, including in the
# seconds after a release is packaged. It is not published content, and it
# records the names of the files in the folder it sits in, so it has no
# business in a public repository.
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
